+# Corpus fetch: rate limit and hosts
+
+Not recorded.
+
+`manifest.tsv`'s header says the files were located via GitHub code search
+(`grep.app`) and fetched raw via `raw.githubusercontent.com` — the only host
+named anywhere. `GATE1.md` says fetching was "rate-limited" but gives no
+number for visits per window, window length, or cooldown after a breach. No
+script, config, or log in this repo states those numbers, and no other
+CDN/mirror host is named.
+
+Rather than invent figures, this file records that gap. If the real limit and
+extra hosts turn up (fetch script, run log), replace this note with them.
